WEBVTT

01:39.320 --> 01:41.560
Sir. Parents are gathering out there.

01:49.200 --> 01:51.280
It's been 22 days!

01:51.880 --> 01:53.440
My son, Hong Jinyang,

01:53.520 --> 01:56.600
is still nowhere to be seen!

01:57.200 --> 01:59.400
I only have one child.

01:59.480 --> 02:03.360
What am I going to do
if something happens to him?

02:04.000 --> 02:05.320
My son…

02:05.400 --> 02:06.240
It has been…

02:07.280 --> 02:08.240
Officer!

02:08.320 --> 02:10.080
-Officer.
-Where is my child?

02:10.160 --> 02:11.840
Please. Officer!

02:11.920 --> 02:12.640
Don't do that.

02:12.720 --> 02:13.640
Please.

02:13.720 --> 02:15.040
-Find my child.
-Everyone.

02:15.120 --> 02:17.040
Everyone. Please calm down.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.680
We are as anxious as you.

02:18.760 --> 02:21.080
We haven't slept for a few days.

02:21.160 --> 02:24.960
Creating a ruckus here
is not going to solve the problem, is it?

02:25.040 --> 02:26.600
-Go. Tear it down.
-Okay.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.480
-No! Don't!
-Who dares to tear it down!

02:29.560 --> 02:30.520
No!

02:30.600 --> 02:32.080
Who said you could tear it down?

02:38.480 --> 02:39.760
Keep the posters up.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.120
Will tearing the posters down
solve the problem?

02:44.480 --> 02:45.960
Will it locate the children?

02:46.040 --> 02:49.400
Citizens can post whatever they want.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.920
Use your expertise

02:54.520 --> 02:56.320
if you want to bring the posters down.

03:01.920 --> 03:03.040
My fellow parents.

03:05.440 --> 03:06.280
I am Zhao Jie,

03:06.360 --> 03:07.320
Captain of the Criminal Department
in Nanshan Branch.

03:08.320 --> 03:11.440
Today, I will give you my word

03:12.160 --> 03:13.440
that within seven days,

03:13.520 --> 03:16.480
we will solve the case
and give you an answer.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.360
If we fail to do so,

03:21.320 --> 03:22.280
I will step down.

03:23.200 --> 03:24.600
I'll take your word for it.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.560
Thank you so much!

03:26.160 --> 03:28.160
-No need to do this.
-Please.

03:29.320 --> 03:30.520
Thank you.

03:33.920 --> 03:36.160
MISSING PERSON

03:43.240 --> 03:45.680
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

03:45.760 --> 03:47.440
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

03:47.520 --> 03:48.520
MISSING PERSONS SPECIAL TASK FORCE

03:48.600 --> 03:50.280
We have questioned everyone
from the illegal internet cafe

03:50.360 --> 03:51.480
in Yuanlongli.

03:51.560 --> 03:54.000
None of the 18 are under suspicion.

03:56.480 --> 03:59.080
All five teenagers went missing
after they skipped classes.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.760
Three of them

04:00.840 --> 04:03.800
last appeared
at the illegal internet cafe.

04:03.880 --> 04:05.520
The victims don't know each other.

04:05.600 --> 04:06.640
They couldn't possibly have

04:06.720 --> 04:07.840
planned together to go
missing voluntarily.

04:07.920 --> 04:09.280
One of them was injured

04:10.040 --> 04:11.080
and is currently traumatized.

04:11.160 --> 04:14.280
We can basically conclude
that it's a serial kidnapping case.

04:15.160 --> 04:16.880
Captain Zhao made a promise yesterday.

04:17.480 --> 04:19.000
We only have seven days.

04:19.079 --> 04:20.440
We must find

04:20.519 --> 04:21.640
these kids within seven days,
even if we have

04:21.720 --> 04:22.600
to turn the entire city upside down.

04:23.720 --> 04:25.360
Good. Speak.

04:25.440 --> 04:28.000
Captain Qu. If this is the doing
of a serial kidnapper,

04:28.080 --> 04:31.160
can we release a statement to the school

04:31.240 --> 04:34.080
clarifying that Han Zi'ang
is the victim of the kidnapping,

04:34.160 --> 04:37.480
and he only attacked someone
out of fear and shock?

04:38.040 --> 04:38.880
You there.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.720
Handle this matter.

04:42.680 --> 04:43.640
Yes, sir!

04:44.560 --> 04:45.680
Let's circle back.

04:47.000 --> 04:50.680
Captain Zhao wants us
to submit a new investigation plan.

04:52.200 --> 04:55.320
Let's work together and brainstorm.

04:57.600 --> 04:58.920
You can still take more pawns.

05:03.320 --> 05:05.560
-Dad.
-That's right.

05:05.640 --> 05:06.760
Hey.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.040
So?

05:11.120 --> 05:12.600
Got your assignment?

05:13.840 --> 05:15.480
Nothing.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.720
Other than a few side-eyes.

05:18.240 --> 05:22.000
Qu Dahai doesn't have
what it takes to solve cases.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.600
He learned a few tricks from Ran
and began to show off.

05:25.320 --> 05:27.520
Sooner or later,
he'll lead the case to a dead end.

05:27.600 --> 05:29.280
We're having an emergency.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.560
Stop saying something unhelpful.

05:31.320 --> 05:34.200
But Ran's theory is still useful.

05:35.880 --> 05:37.400
Everything has a center.

05:37.480 --> 05:38.640
And outside the center,
there will be ripples.

05:39.760 --> 05:42.080
Dad. I've read the book thrice.

05:42.160 --> 05:43.600
What are you getting at?

05:47.600 --> 05:52.040
CHAPTER 2: "EYE OF THE VORTEX THEORY"

05:56.360 --> 05:58.280
To see the eye of the vortex,

05:58.360 --> 06:00.160
you must be part of it.

06:02.960 --> 06:04.640
The Eye of the Vortex Theory.

06:08.200 --> 06:09.480
Officer He,

06:09.560 --> 06:11.920
I don't know anything
about investigations.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.960
But allow me to thank you
on behalf of the school.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.680
If you hadn't defended

06:16.760 --> 06:18.520
Han Zi'ang this relentlessly,

06:18.600 --> 06:21.080
this turn of events
wouldn't have occurred at all.

06:21.160 --> 06:24.640
Right now, the students
and the parents no longer view Han Zi'ang

06:24.720 --> 06:27.000
as a problematic student,

06:27.080 --> 06:29.560
but as a hero who fought
against the kidnapper.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.000
Principal Qin.

06:32.080 --> 06:34.640
I still need your help
to identify the culprit.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.920
Me?

06:37.480 --> 06:38.560
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL

07:08.760 --> 07:09.640
Class, stand!

07:10.640 --> 07:14.600
-Good morning, sir.
-Sit down.

07:15.280 --> 07:16.760
Open your geometry textbooks.

07:16.840 --> 07:19.040
Let's have a recap
of what we learned previously.

07:21.640 --> 07:25.280
Bye, sir.

07:25.360 --> 07:26.760
Bye.

07:32.040 --> 07:34.680
Miss, are you role-playing as Han Zi'ang?

07:34.760 --> 07:35.960
Yes.

07:36.040 --> 07:37.600
He isn't as spirited as you are.

07:37.680 --> 07:39.520
He spends half of his day sleeping.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.320
Then what does he do
for the rest of his day?

07:41.400 --> 07:43.720
Reading comics. His mind
lives in another dimension.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.920
Xuan. Over here.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.920
Han Zi'ang is a weirdo, right?

07:49.000 --> 07:51.480
Yes. We can't understand
what he says at all.

07:51.560 --> 07:53.640
I think he's obsessed with a cosplayer.

07:53.720 --> 07:54.880
He even said he'd attend
a comic convention

07:54.960 --> 07:56.240
in Shanghai during summer break.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.800
No need to search online.
His interest has changed.

07:59.880 --> 08:01.520
He is now a fan of an anime.

08:02.200 --> 08:05.240
Right. He loves… What is she called again?

08:06.000 --> 08:07.400
Nangong…

08:08.080 --> 08:09.000
This one here.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.200
Yes! Nangong Xuanyue.

08:15.280 --> 08:16.120
NANGONG XUANYUE

08:18.960 --> 08:21.760
TOGETHER FOR YOUR HEALTH
UNITED IN TRUST AND CARE

08:21.840 --> 08:22.960
Drink some water.

08:31.200 --> 08:34.240
Everyone at school
knows you're the victim.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.799
Principal Qin said you were very brave.

08:35.880 --> 08:38.799
They are looking forward to your return.

08:38.880 --> 08:40.039
Ang.

08:40.880 --> 08:42.919
Do you hear me?

09:25.520 --> 09:26.720
Xuanyue.

09:28.760 --> 09:29.760
You've come back.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.320
He Xiaohe!

09:42.400 --> 09:43.840
-Calm down.
-He Xiaohe!

09:43.920 --> 09:45.040
-He Xiaohe!
-You can't go in.

09:45.840 --> 09:46.840
-You can't enter.
-Let me.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.800
You can't enter.
There's no one else inside.

09:48.880 --> 09:50.400
We've brought everyone out.

09:50.480 --> 09:52.320
Please calm down.
We've brought everyone out.

09:52.400 --> 09:54.880
POLICE

10:05.840 --> 10:07.320
Uncle Ran.

10:07.400 --> 10:08.560
Are you injured?

10:15.720 --> 10:17.160
Keyboard!

10:17.240 --> 10:18.400
Keyboard…

10:19.560 --> 10:20.520
Where were you?

10:21.200 --> 10:22.040
Hey!

10:22.640 --> 10:23.960
She was at my place.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.440
Who are you?

10:26.480 --> 10:28.120
Why was she at your place?
What did you do to her?

10:28.200 --> 10:29.800
-She clung to me!
-Tell me!

10:30.360 --> 10:31.440
-What did you do to her?
-Stop!

10:31.520 --> 10:33.480
-Let go!
-Do you know how old she is?

10:33.560 --> 10:34.600
Let go…

10:35.360 --> 10:36.360
What is wrong with you?

10:36.440 --> 10:38.560
-He's my friend, not a criminal!
-Come.

10:38.640 --> 10:39.760
Come back with me.

10:41.040 --> 10:43.320
-Come!
-No! Let go of me!

10:43.400 --> 10:44.920
I won't come back with you.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.520
You don't even know what happened.

10:46.600 --> 10:48.080
Don't just assume everything.

10:48.160 --> 10:50.360
So much for thinking
you are my best friend!

10:59.000 --> 11:00.240
Xiaohe!

11:05.840 --> 11:06.720
Double Stripe.

11:06.800 --> 11:08.240
You peed here last time.

11:08.320 --> 11:10.760
I've held a lot this time. Let's compete.

11:11.280 --> 11:13.840
-You? Maybe after you beat Bunny first.
-Come.

11:13.920 --> 11:15.360
Come.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.280
Ready.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.760
Three.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.360
Two.

11:21.880 --> 11:23.800
Why did you shout?

11:27.560 --> 11:28.680
What is that?

11:30.880 --> 11:32.160
What…

11:35.720 --> 11:36.600
It… It might be a person.

11:38.040 --> 11:38.880
It is a person.

11:57.200 --> 11:58.680
I've never met her.

12:00.680 --> 12:02.320
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.280
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.360
Open the shutter.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.400
Open it.

12:34.040 --> 12:34.840
Put her in here.

12:36.960 --> 12:39.080
JIAJIA GROCERY

12:39.160 --> 12:41.440
Mister, we found a frozen girl.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.960
Bring her inside.
Don't freeze her to death.

12:45.040 --> 12:46.880
-Come.
-Fine.

12:48.680 --> 12:50.480
One, two, three.

12:50.560 --> 12:51.680
Let's go.

12:52.400 --> 12:54.000
Careful.

12:55.320 --> 12:56.360
Careful.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.120
Careful.

12:59.440 --> 13:03.360
TUNZHOU CITY

13:03.440 --> 13:04.520
TUNZHOU LOCAL FAVORITES

13:08.960 --> 13:09.920
Mister.

13:10.520 --> 13:12.840
-A bowl of noodles, please.
-Sure. Please go inside.

13:33.160 --> 13:34.600
Enjoy. Careful. It's hot.

13:36.520 --> 13:37.400
Mister,

13:37.920 --> 13:39.920
do you know

13:40.000 --> 13:43.600
any unique places in Tunzhou,

13:43.680 --> 13:46.600
or maybe a place
photographers love to visit?

13:46.680 --> 13:48.360
There are plenty of them.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.280
Look.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.880
We have Yongji Bridge,

13:50.960 --> 13:53.640
Sanyi Temple, Zhang Fei's Shrine,

13:53.720 --> 13:55.280
and this, Tunzhou Twin Towers.

13:56.280 --> 13:58.640
-Mister. Can I have some pepper?
-Sure.

13:58.720 --> 14:01.760
YONGJI BRIDGE
SANYI TEMPLE, ZHANG FEI'S SHRINE

14:17.320 --> 14:18.400
Mister.

14:18.480 --> 14:22.600
Any place that is quite desolate?

14:22.680 --> 14:24.320
A place that has been abandoned for years.

14:25.880 --> 14:27.320
What a peculiar preference.

14:30.040 --> 14:31.200
Here.

14:31.720 --> 14:32.840
This one here?

14:34.120 --> 14:35.720
COPPER FACTORY

14:38.640 --> 14:39.960
Copper Factory.

14:45.680 --> 14:49.040
JIAJIA GROCERY

14:51.480 --> 14:52.640
CONVENIENT AND AFFORDABLE

15:09.960 --> 15:10.960
Send in the soldiers.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.640
Bunny.

15:20.120 --> 15:21.880
This girl is so fierce.

15:26.520 --> 15:27.680
Wake up!

15:29.560 --> 15:30.440
You…

15:30.960 --> 15:32.880
Who are you? Who the heck are you?

15:32.960 --> 15:34.640
-Who are you?
-Help!

15:34.720 --> 15:36.040
Who are you?

15:37.160 --> 15:39.480
Stop hitting him. Stop hitting him.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.560
-Get her!
-Bring it on!

15:45.720 --> 15:47.280
Bring it on!

15:47.360 --> 15:48.600
Don't try to mess with me.

15:50.120 --> 15:51.720
Stop!

15:54.240 --> 15:55.480
Don't come any closer!

16:15.840 --> 16:16.720
Hello?

16:16.800 --> 16:18.840
Hello, Dad.

16:18.920 --> 16:20.400
Xiaohe.

16:21.000 --> 16:22.640
Where are you calling me from?

16:24.760 --> 16:26.280
The shop by the school's gate.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.400
It's so late now.

16:28.480 --> 16:29.480
Why aren't you at school?

16:29.560 --> 16:30.880
Why are you calling me?

16:32.120 --> 16:33.560
Nothing.

16:37.720 --> 16:39.480
Then I'll hang up now.

16:39.560 --> 16:41.320
My phone is dying.

16:41.400 --> 16:42.680
Go back to your class.

16:42.760 --> 16:45.000
Finish your homework and eat on time.

16:45.080 --> 16:46.520
Listen to Uncle Ran.

16:47.240 --> 16:48.200
Do you hear me?

16:50.360 --> 16:51.480
Hello?

16:51.560 --> 16:52.600
Hello?

16:55.400 --> 16:57.240
She's skipping classes again.

17:05.200 --> 17:07.119
Keyboard. You're gone.

17:07.200 --> 17:08.599
The band is gone.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.839
No one at home cares about me.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.560
Where should I go now?

17:17.560 --> 17:20.680
If you really want to learn music,
you can go to Beijing.

17:23.839 --> 17:25.200
Go home now.

17:25.800 --> 17:28.280
This place is not an orphanage.

17:29.040 --> 17:29.880
Exactly.

17:36.680 --> 17:39.440
Please don't kick me out.

17:39.520 --> 17:40.520
My dad…

17:41.040 --> 17:42.800
I was adopted.

17:42.880 --> 17:45.240
My dad hits me every day
and forces me to drop out of school.

17:45.320 --> 17:47.000
I'm too scared to go home.

17:47.080 --> 17:49.120
I want to work

17:49.200 --> 17:51.920
to pay for my tuition.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.200
What a rough childhood.

17:54.280 --> 17:55.800
No wonder she's so violent.

17:57.360 --> 17:59.920
Mister, help her out.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.320
She has to work to fund her studies.

18:01.400 --> 18:02.960
That's already tough enough.

18:03.560 --> 18:06.440
Mister, let me help you in your shop.

18:06.520 --> 18:08.120
I only have one rule.

18:08.800 --> 18:10.640
The internet cafe
downstairs is unlicensed.

18:10.720 --> 18:12.160
So don't mess it up for me.

18:41.200 --> 18:42.720
You must be Wan Qiming.

18:45.000 --> 18:46.000
POLICE

18:47.720 --> 18:48.960
So, you found me after all.

18:54.560 --> 18:56.520
I met her through a magazine.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.240
We were pen pals.

19:00.520 --> 19:02.560
We wrote more than
ten letters to each other.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.840
We had feelings for each other.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.360
So, we decided to meet up.

19:09.400 --> 19:10.320
It became official then.

19:11.760 --> 19:13.040
I began to look for a job in Weiyang.

19:21.160 --> 19:22.960
She's a bit color-blind.

19:23.040 --> 19:26.160
So I only took monochrome photos of her.

19:26.240 --> 19:28.800
As time went by, it became a habit.

19:29.400 --> 19:30.200
I don't take colored photos anymore.

19:30.920 --> 19:32.840
Around three months after we met,

19:32.920 --> 19:34.080
she brought me home.

19:34.920 --> 19:37.480
Her relatives were quite fond of me.

19:37.560 --> 19:40.160
Her father was eccentric,

19:40.240 --> 19:41.480
but he didn't say no to it.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.920
Everything was going so well.

19:58.520 --> 19:59.800
Qiming.

20:01.280 --> 20:02.440
Let's get married.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.240
Meng.

20:11.760 --> 20:14.280
Come with me to Guangdong.

20:15.760 --> 20:17.280
I'd love to marry you,

20:17.960 --> 20:19.480
but I don't have a career now.

20:19.560 --> 20:20.840
Weiyang is too small.

20:20.920 --> 20:23.360
I don't want to stay here
doing wedding photography forever.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.920
Let's work hard for a few years.

20:26.000 --> 20:28.280
Once our careers are stable,
we'll get married.

20:31.720 --> 20:32.880
What's the matter?

20:34.920 --> 20:37.120
I don't want a career.

20:39.360 --> 20:41.320
I just want a family.

20:46.040 --> 20:47.960
But we're still young.

20:48.960 --> 20:51.080
We can prove ourselves.

20:52.000 --> 20:53.800
-Do you know that--
-Qiming.

20:54.840 --> 20:56.000
I can't leave my dad.

20:58.520 --> 21:00.200
Can you stay in Weiyang?

21:10.240 --> 21:12.920
In the end, I decided
to head to Guangdong.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.360
We separated

21:15.440 --> 21:17.480
and resumed our written communication,
as we did before.

21:18.560 --> 21:21.200
Then she said she'd wait for me,

21:21.280 --> 21:24.760
that once I earned enough money,
I'd return to Weiyang to marry her.

21:25.360 --> 21:26.640
I said yes.

21:28.080 --> 21:29.320
And then?

21:30.000 --> 21:33.000
After more than six months,
she stopped replying to my letters.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.080
I called her home,
but no one would pick up.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.320
During the Qingming Festival of 1996,

21:37.400 --> 21:38.720
I told my mentor

21:38.800 --> 21:40.480
that I wanted to return home
to pay respect to my ancestors.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.920
But in fact, I went
to Weiyang to look for her.

22:27.800 --> 22:29.400
That's when I learned

22:29.920 --> 22:32.320
that she and her father
were in the accident at Mount Wu.

22:33.080 --> 22:36.320
To treat her dad, she took out loans.

22:37.880 --> 22:39.680
But what I couldn't accept

22:40.200 --> 22:42.400
was that Xu Zhihong
forced his daughter to…

22:42.480 --> 22:43.840
For his medical bill.

23:06.120 --> 23:07.200
Meng.

23:08.320 --> 23:09.680
Come with me.

23:10.760 --> 23:12.320
Let's go to Guangdong.

23:17.720 --> 23:18.800
Just leave.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.480
I don't mind what you used to do.

23:25.440 --> 23:27.360
My career is blooming right now.

23:28.360 --> 23:29.600
We'll get married
once we arrive in Guangdong.

23:30.520 --> 23:32.920
We'll build a family. Okay?

23:34.320 --> 23:35.600
Please?

23:38.600 --> 23:40.560
I gave you a chance back then.

23:41.160 --> 23:43.000
Now, there's no way I can leave Weiyang.

23:44.200 --> 23:45.560
Why do you want

23:46.600 --> 23:48.480
to stay in this broken home of yours?

23:54.040 --> 23:55.920
My dad is back. Go inside.

23:56.760 --> 23:57.600
Go inside.

24:02.720 --> 24:04.560
You jerk.

24:04.640 --> 24:06.880
You dumped Meng and ran away.

24:06.960 --> 24:10.000
I knew you were not a good man.

24:10.080 --> 24:11.480
Why are you back?

24:12.240 --> 24:14.760
What do you want?
To lure her away with your lies again?

24:14.840 --> 24:17.000
Dad. He came back to visit me.
He'll leave soon.

24:17.080 --> 24:18.280
-Move aside!
-He'll leave soon.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.680
Bugger off!

24:22.080 --> 24:24.440
Bugger off! Bugger off! Bugger off!

24:24.520 --> 24:25.960
Do not touch me!

24:26.040 --> 24:27.480
You're a father.

24:27.560 --> 24:30.000
Yet you forced your daughter
to sell her body.

24:30.080 --> 24:31.640
What kind of man are you?

24:32.160 --> 24:33.680
Who are you to judge me?

24:34.640 --> 24:37.240
This is my home. I have the final say.

24:37.320 --> 24:40.080
As long as I still live,

24:40.160 --> 24:42.640
you will not take Meng away.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.560
Dad, sit down.

24:45.040 --> 24:46.160
-Bugger off!
-Dad.

24:47.160 --> 24:48.920
Just go! Dad.

24:52.520 --> 24:53.680
I wasn't willing to let it go initially,

24:53.760 --> 24:56.200
so I hired the neighbor
opposite them to spy on them

24:57.840 --> 25:00.000
and see what's going on every day.

25:00.520 --> 25:03.400
Actually, I was hoping
that the old man would die soon.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.720
What did your informant tell you?

25:08.200 --> 25:09.320
Nothing in particular.

25:10.640 --> 25:12.320
Just that she kept working

25:13.960 --> 25:15.200
in that line of work.

25:16.240 --> 25:17.320
If one place was busted,

25:17.960 --> 25:19.240
she would find another.

25:20.320 --> 25:21.160
And then?

25:22.480 --> 25:25.000
Then, a few months ago, I saw the news

25:25.080 --> 25:26.720
that her father had died.

25:35.360 --> 25:38.520
Xu Zhihong was a selfish man.

25:39.600 --> 25:40.800
Did he not deserve death?

25:42.000 --> 25:43.480
Did he not deserve to be killed?

25:48.400 --> 25:50.640
Do you think Xu Meng is dead?

25:52.280 --> 25:53.560
I'm not sure about that.

25:55.080 --> 25:57.320
But when we were pen pals, I had a hunch

25:57.920 --> 25:59.520
that she had other pen pals.

26:00.600 --> 26:03.800
She is the kind of girl
who likes to be doted on.

26:03.880 --> 26:05.240
She has a temper.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.160
She is prideful.

26:08.040 --> 26:10.520
Girls like her, in that line of work,

26:11.320 --> 26:12.560
will offend a lot of people.

26:14.160 --> 26:16.840
Mr. Officer, I've told you
everything I can.

26:18.760 --> 26:20.360
I didn't kill Xu Zhihong.

26:22.280 --> 26:23.480
And I'd never hurt Xu Meng.

26:25.480 --> 26:26.520
Xu Meng and her father

26:27.160 --> 26:29.200
went missing the day before
the Hong Kong handover.

26:29.840 --> 26:32.280
My mentor took a gig back then

26:32.800 --> 26:34.120
and brought me to Hong Kong to shoot

26:34.200 --> 26:36.080
the lives of the Hong Kong citizens
before the reunification.

26:36.160 --> 26:38.760
I was already away by the middle of June.

26:42.600 --> 26:44.120
I have an alibi.

26:55.840 --> 26:56.840
Zhao Jie.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.240
I was looking for you.

26:58.320 --> 27:00.240
This is the department's
annual budget. Please sign it.

27:00.840 --> 27:02.040
I'm here to report a case.

27:02.720 --> 27:05.520
He Xiaohe, resident of Unit 401,
Block 7, Ward 12, Poluo Street,

27:05.600 --> 27:07.320
13 years old, might have gone missing.

27:08.120 --> 27:09.200
I thought it was something serious.

27:09.280 --> 27:10.760
-That's just Xiaohe being Xiaohe.
-Exactly.

27:10.840 --> 27:12.600
She runs away every few days.

27:17.160 --> 27:18.800
Okay. Report received.

27:18.880 --> 27:20.760
-Chen. Register it right away.
-Okay.

27:23.360 --> 27:25.960
Before she went missing, she was with me.

27:26.040 --> 27:28.200
A good friend of hers
died in a fire in the bar.

27:28.280 --> 27:29.920
She is probably traumatized.

27:30.000 --> 27:30.920
I've heard about it.

27:31.000 --> 27:32.600
The victim was locked in the storeroom.

27:32.680 --> 27:34.280
Someone next door didn't
extinguish their cigarette properly,

27:34.360 --> 27:35.520
and it fell on the carpet.

27:35.600 --> 27:37.000
The fire burned everything.

27:37.520 --> 27:38.800
The victim was called Keyboard.

27:39.880 --> 27:40.920
I knew him too.

27:46.600 --> 27:48.200
Check every location on this list.

27:48.280 --> 27:49.360
Mobilize the officers
with Mangkun as soon as possible.

27:49.440 --> 27:50.360
Okay.

27:50.920 --> 27:51.760
Here. Take a look.

27:52.520 --> 27:53.680
Chen, have you registered the case?

27:53.760 --> 27:55.280
The important information is in it.

27:55.360 --> 27:57.040
-Have you seen this girl?
-No.

27:57.120 --> 27:58.600
Take a look. Have you seen this girl?

27:58.680 --> 28:00.320
-Let me see.
-Take a look.

28:00.400 --> 28:02.040
She's this tall. Around 13 years old.

28:02.120 --> 28:03.280
DRUMS, PERCUSSION

28:05.760 --> 28:07.280
Sir, this is
the security footage for today.

28:07.360 --> 28:08.200
Can you fast forward it?

28:08.280 --> 28:09.000
-Sure.
-Fast forward it.

28:09.520 --> 28:10.720
Let me skim through it.

28:10.800 --> 28:11.720
SUNDAY

28:14.040 --> 28:15.120
WEIYANG PARK, WEIYANG SQUARE
NANSHAN SUPERMARKET, WEIYANG BOOK STORE…

28:17.200 --> 28:18.440
WEIYANG TRAIN STATION

28:28.640 --> 28:30.360
CALLS

28:30.440 --> 28:31.440
MENTOR

28:31.520 --> 28:34.280
The number you're dialing
has been switched off.

28:34.360 --> 28:35.760
Please try again later.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.880
END CALL

28:38.520 --> 28:39.600
POLICE

28:39.680 --> 28:41.040
-Check inside.
-Okay.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.080
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

28:46.360 --> 28:47.400
Don't mind me.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.720
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

29:06.880 --> 29:08.120
RIVERSIDE MARKET

29:13.280 --> 29:15.160
How am I supposed to go back to Ran now?

29:17.000 --> 29:18.360
It's so cold now.

29:18.440 --> 29:19.880
Where could she have gone?

29:22.720 --> 29:25.360
She has always been
a hyperactive troublemaker.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.760
I'm sure she's fine.

29:30.440 --> 29:32.640
JIAJIA GROCERY

29:44.600 --> 29:45.680
CHINESE CHESS

29:52.320 --> 29:53.400
See you.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.480
Come back again.

30:10.960 --> 30:11.800
Thank you.

30:11.880 --> 30:13.800
Little girl, do you have cigarettes here?

30:13.880 --> 30:15.800
No. Only snacks and drinks.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.440
Can you get me two soft packs of Yuxi?

30:18.520 --> 30:19.920
You can keep the change.

30:27.960 --> 30:29.280
Yuxi is 21 yuan a pack.

30:29.360 --> 30:30.560
This is a huge deal.

30:31.680 --> 30:33.440
Thank you, mister.
I'll get your cigarettes now.

30:34.760 --> 30:36.880
-Look after this for me.
-Okay.

30:37.840 --> 30:39.040
ROUTE 36 TRAIN STATION TO MALL STREET

31:18.400 --> 31:19.240
Keyboard.

31:20.560 --> 31:22.880
How are you on the other side?

31:24.000 --> 31:26.960
Make sure you're practicing there too.

31:27.920 --> 31:31.600
You will be the best keyboardist ever.

31:34.840 --> 31:35.920
Also,

31:36.840 --> 31:38.200
don't be a chicken.

31:39.360 --> 31:40.560
You'll get bullied like this.

31:57.920 --> 31:58.880
POLICE

32:26.120 --> 32:27.760
MOUNT WU TOURIST AREA

32:27.840 --> 32:29.160
A three-day trip to Mount Wu.

32:29.680 --> 32:30.920
Come take a look.

32:32.000 --> 32:33.480
It's our new offer.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.400
Have you heard of it?

32:34.480 --> 32:36.240
Sir. Sir.

32:36.320 --> 32:37.880
New offer, new promotion.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.040
Come take a look.

32:41.200 --> 32:42.600
New offer, new promotion.

32:42.680 --> 32:44.360
-Do you go to the train station?
-Come in.

32:45.760 --> 32:47.000
Sir!

32:47.640 --> 32:49.480
Sir. It has been a few tough years.

32:49.560 --> 32:50.720
Give me a chance. Take a look.

32:51.960 --> 32:53.000
Thank you.

32:53.080 --> 32:57.040
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

32:58.280 --> 32:59.360
We have a new offer.

32:59.440 --> 33:00.360
Sorry.

33:00.440 --> 33:01.960
New offer, new promotion.

33:05.360 --> 33:06.520
Coming!

33:08.440 --> 33:10.520
When is the next departure date?

33:10.600 --> 33:11.440
Which one?

33:12.040 --> 33:13.520
The three-day Mount Wu trip.

33:13.600 --> 33:14.600
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY, MOUNT WU TOUR
FRIDAY DEPARTURES, 3-DAY TRIP

33:17.920 --> 33:20.440
JIAJIA GROCERY

33:22.640 --> 33:24.520
I bought you an egg each.
Come get your nutrition.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.600
You've worked so hard.

33:28.680 --> 33:30.960
Have you earned enough
for your tuition fee?

33:34.560 --> 33:35.640
Truth be told,

33:36.320 --> 33:37.600
I'm trying

33:37.680 --> 33:39.520
to save for my train ticket to Beijing.

33:40.120 --> 33:41.240
To Beijing?

33:41.320 --> 33:43.440
Are you going there
to study at Tsinghua University?

33:43.520 --> 33:44.640
Little girl.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.560
The usual, please.

33:46.120 --> 33:47.640
You can keep the change.

33:49.120 --> 33:49.960
Thank you, mister.

33:51.120 --> 33:52.120
Wait.

33:52.960 --> 33:53.800
The beer is on me.

33:56.880 --> 33:58.640
I'm a Buddhist. I don't drink.

33:58.720 --> 33:59.760
Thank you, though.

34:01.480 --> 34:05.360
SPICY CHICKEN BITES
WITH SECRET FAMILY RECIPE

34:22.040 --> 34:23.040
Sorry.

34:25.120 --> 34:26.679
He Xiaohe. Is that a cigarette pack I see?

34:29.239 --> 34:30.159
Stay right there!

34:33.679 --> 34:34.800
Stay right there!

34:39.159 --> 34:40.440
He Xiaohe. Stay right there.

34:40.520 --> 34:41.120
YUXI CIGARETTE

34:41.199 --> 34:42.840
She can run.

34:43.520 --> 34:44.520
Stay right there.

34:45.040 --> 34:46.320
Stop. Stay right there.

34:49.600 --> 34:50.440
Stop.

34:55.760 --> 34:57.440
He Xiaohe. Stop.

34:57.520 --> 34:59.320
You really can run.

35:20.640 --> 35:21.600
Let's see where you can go now.

35:23.280 --> 35:24.240
I'll stay.

35:42.320 --> 35:43.960
-Bye, sir.
-You…

35:53.040 --> 35:54.400
1.4 meters. This tall.

35:54.480 --> 35:55.440
Take a look.

35:59.480 --> 36:01.120
Mister.

36:01.200 --> 36:02.280
Zhao Jie.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.160
Captain Ran. Qu.

36:12.560 --> 36:14.760
It was very cold that night.
She couldn't have run far.

36:14.840 --> 36:17.200
Focus on the 24-hour shops

36:17.280 --> 36:18.840
within the red circles.

36:19.520 --> 36:20.880
Let's split up and search.

36:20.960 --> 36:21.920
It'll be more efficient.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.480
Mangkun, Chen. You guys go here.

36:23.560 --> 36:24.680
I'll take this one. Okay?

36:24.760 --> 36:26.280
-Okay.
-Split the workload among yourselves.

36:26.800 --> 36:28.120
Hi, Mr. Zhang.

36:28.200 --> 36:29.160
Hello?

36:29.240 --> 36:30.880
Are you the parent of He Xiaohe?

36:30.960 --> 36:32.920
She didn't come to class today.

36:33.000 --> 36:35.520
I saw her running around with cigarettes.
Will you please discipline her?

36:36.680 --> 36:38.400
When? Where did you see her?

36:38.480 --> 36:39.880
Tell me more.

36:43.360 --> 36:44.400
I see.

36:44.480 --> 36:45.680
Forgive me, Mr. Zhang.

36:45.760 --> 36:46.960
I'll lecture her later.

36:49.200 --> 36:50.080
Xiaohe has appeared.

36:50.160 --> 36:52.120
Someone saw her
buying cigarettes at Nanhu Market.

36:52.200 --> 36:53.800
They even found
bus tickets in her pockets.

36:53.880 --> 36:55.520
Nanhu Market.

36:55.600 --> 36:56.640
Bus tickets.

36:56.720 --> 36:57.880
And cigarettes too?

37:02.280 --> 37:04.480
Check all bus stations
that serve Nanhu Market.

37:04.560 --> 37:05.440
Okay.

37:05.520 --> 37:06.960
NANHU MARKET
